The Go Programming Language Specification 1.27, as kept in the cosmoes.org library
==================================================================================

This folder is a copy of The Go Programming Language Specification 1.27, kept at
https://cosmoes.org/library/go/spec/1.27/, not the publisher's own page.
The publisher is The Go Authors (Google); its own page for this text is https://go.dev/ref/spec
The files under files/ are the publisher's files as they came from https://go.dev/dl/go1.27.4.src.tar.gz
on 2026-11-22T18:34:26Z (FETCHED, SHA256SUMS). Nothing in them is changed.

Changed in form
---------------
Rendered as HTML from a text extraction of the publisher's HTML, by rule: headings, paragraphs, list items, table cells and preformatted blocks kept in order with their ids; scripts, styles, images, navigation and all other markup dropped. The publisher's file is kept unchanged beside the page.

